    "description": "Natural Mineral Specimen Lot\nAmethyst, Agate, Quartz, and Pyrite\nMultiple Items, Vintage Natural Stones\nThis collection features a variety of natural geological specimens, highlighting the diverse formations of quartz and agate. The lot includes significant pieces such as a banded agate block and a large clear quartz cluster, alongside amethyst geodes and pyrite, suitable for study or display.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nAmethyst Geode Half\n- Purple crystalline interior\n2.\nAgate Geode Half\n- Concentric rings with quartz center\n3.\nQuartz Cluster\n- Large specimen with natural terminations\n4.\nCut Agate Block\n- Polished face with dark banding\n5.\nPyrite Clusters\n- Metallic cubic patterns\n6.\nAgate Slice\n- Lavender semi-translucent slab\n7.\nAssorted Fragments\n- Small quartz points and geode samples\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition. Specimens show natural surface variations and minor edge wear. Polished surfaces have light scuffs consistent with handling and age. Natural dust is present in recessed areas. All items are structurally sound.\nWarehouse Location: Canton\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
